		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμιόργιον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημιουργ-ούργιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>office of the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημιουργοί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				3502
			</span></i> (Cnidus, also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημιουργ-εῖον</span></b> , τό, ib.<i><span class="en">
