			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>meeting of the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ., ἐν ἐννόμψ δαμιουργίψ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					830.3
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>).</div>
